    <us-gaap:StockholdersEquityNoteDisclosureTextBlock contextRef="c-1" id="f-1319">&amp;lt;p&amp;gt;The rights of the holders of each class of our common and capital stock are identical, except with respect to voting. Each share of Class A common stock is entitled to one vote per share. Each share of Class B common stock is entitled to 10 votes per share. Shares of Class B common stock may be converted at any time at the option of the stockholder and automatically convert upon sale or transfer to Class A common stock.&amp;lt;/p&amp;gt;</us-gaap:StockholdersEquityNoteDisclosureTextBlock>
